                "He spoke of the threat, the threat that Dmitri had made in public, the threat that had been heard by many witnesses, the threat that proved, he said, the intent to murder.",
                "He spoke of the character of the accused, the wildness, the drunkenness, the debts, the jealousy, the passion, and he painted a portrait of a man who was capable of anything.",
                "And the jury listened, and the jury believed, and the jury was ready to convict before the defense had even begun.",
                "The defense rose, and the defense was also brilliant, and the defense argued that the evidence was circumstantial, that there was no proof, that Dmitri was innocent.",
                "The defense spoke of the honor of the accused, the honor that had made him return the money that he had taken, the honor that had made him accept the punishment that he had not deserved.",
                "The defense spoke of the character of the accused, the generosity, the honesty, the willingness to suffer, and he painted a portrait of a man who was incapable of murder.",
                "And the jury listened, and the jury was moved, and the jury was uncertain, and for a moment, it seemed that Dmitri might be acquitted.",
                "But the prosecutor rose again, and the prosecutor demolished the defense, and the prosecutor reminded the jury of the evidence, of the money, of the letter, of the threat.",
                "And the jury retired, and the jury deliberated, and the jury returned, and the verdict was guilty, and the verdict was inevitable, and the verdict was wrong.",
                "And so the trial came to an end, and the crowd dispersed, and the town returned to its ordinary life, and Dmitri was taken away to begin his twenty years of hard labor.",
                "And the trial was a mirror, a mirror in which every person in the courtroom saw himself, and the image that they saw was not the image that they had expected."
            ))
        )
