            EnChapter(3, "The Lovers", listOf(
                "Emma had her first affair with a young man named Léon, a clerk in the town of Yonville, a young man who was romantic and idealistic and who seemed to share her dreams.",
                "The affair was innocent, at first, a meeting of souls, a sharing of poetry and passion, a love that was not yet physical but was already dangerous.",
                "But Léon left for Paris, and Emma was left alone with her longing, and her longing grew, and her longing consumed her.",
